      "text": "Rihanna: Live in Concert Tour\nRihanna : Live in Concert Tour was the debut concert tour by Barbadian recording artist Rihanna . Taking place during the summer of 2006 , the tour supported both her debut studio album Music of the Sun and her second studio album A Girl like Me and traveled across North America ."
